hop into a car and drive freely across the terrain, forging your own path of exploration between story objectives. Every corner of this handcrafted world is designed to reward the curious.<br><strong>Unravel a Compelling Narrative:\u00a0</strong>Interact with a core cast of characters, each with their own stake in the unfolding story. Progress through a compelling, quest-driven main story and take on optional side quests to uncover more about the world and earn valuable rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Loomeit Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795000/b6126bcef53734d4629e1e64e8b72bde2d0182f9/header.jpg?t=1758561392","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Loomeit Studios. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3795000/271045168/c906e6e4deeab3bac19be858e0da6f194cbf2df8/1752697098/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753453767","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3795000/271045168/c906e6e4deeab3bac19be858e0da6f194cbf2df8/1752697098/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753453767","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3795000/271045168/c906e6e4deeab3bac19be858e0da6f194cbf2df8/1752697098/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753453767","id":257167772,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167772/movie480.mp4?t=1753453767","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167772/movie_max.mp4?t=1753453767"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbna